<title>FRANCE: France sees 97 rapeseed sowings at 947,000 ha.</title>
<headline>France sees 97 rapeseed sowings at 947,000 ha.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's farm ministry forecast on Monday spring and winter rapeseed sowings for the 1997 harvest at 947,000 hectares, up 8.2 percent over 1996.</p>
<p>The new estimate brings sowings for winter rapeseed at 930,000 hectares, barely changed from a February estimate and up 8.2 percent over 1996.</p>
<p>The ministry, in its first estimate for sowings of spring rapeseed, said area may rise by 8.5 percent to 17,000 hectares.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
